{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The men were sent off, they and their donkeys, they left the city.</b> This too is among the allusions in the Torah, for the attribute of strict justice was stretched out against them on account of the sin of the sale. And I have already explained to you in the matter of the generation of the Dispersion (דור הפלגה) that in every place where you find the special Name inscribed in reverse (רשום למפרע), it is an allusion to the attribute of strict justice, and because of this the brothers of Yosef needed to turn back on their way toward the land of their desire." "<b>They had not gone far.</b> So as not to trouble them, that they would need to return from a distant place."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:07.639584853Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}